# Tailwind v4 `@theme` Conventions

## CSS Custom Property Naming

All theme tokens live in `src/app/theme.css` inside the `@theme {}` block.

### Text preset sub-properties

Use **double-dash** (`--`) to separate the base token name from its modifier. This is required for Tailwind v4 to recognise them as sub-values of the utility.

```css
/* ❌ BAD — single dash; Tailwind ignores these as sub-properties */
--text-preset-1-line-height: 1.4;
--text-preset-1-letter-spacing: -0.125rem;
--text-preset-1-weight: 700;

/* ✅ GOOD — double dash separator */
--text-preset-1: 3.25rem;
--text-preset-1--line-height: 1.4;
--text-preset-1--letter-spacing: -0.125rem;
--text-preset-1--font-weight: 700;
```

### Modifier names

| Property      | Correct modifier      |
|---------------|-----------------------|
| line-height   | `--line-height`       |
| letter-spacing| `--letter-spacing`    |
| font-weight   | `--font-weight`  ⚠️ NOT `--weight` |
